下设: \[
\begin{align}
\cos a &= \frac{3}{5}, \qquad \text{换算为最简比}: \qquad \bigg(\cos a\bigg)^{\!2} &= \bigg(\frac{3}{5}\bigg)^{\!2}, \qquad \bigg(\sin a\bigg)^{\!2} &= 1 - \bigg(\frac{3}{5}\bigg)^{\!2} \\
                 &= \frac{16}{25} \cdots \qquad \text{取平方根: } \qquad \bigg(\sin a\bigg)^{\!2} &= \frac{16}{25}, \qquad \bigg(\sin a\bigg)^{\!2} &= \frac{4}{5}.
\end{align}
\]

由于 $a$ 是锐角，所以 $a$ 是否等于 $360^{\circ}k + 45^{\circ}$, $45^{\circ}$, $135^{\circ}$, $225^{\circ}$, $315^{\circ}$ 其中，$k$ 为整数。$k = 0$ 时，$a = 45^{\circ}$。对于进一步确定 $a < b$，我们注意到：\[
\begin{align}
(\sin a)^{\!2} &> (\sin b)^{\!2}, \\
\frac{4}{5} &> \frac{144}{169} \\
\implies 676 &> 660 \implies 16 &> 0,
\end{align}
\]所以 $\sin a > \sin b$. 因此：\[
\begin{align}
\bigg(\sin b\bigg)^{\!2} &= \frac{144}{169}, \qquad \bigg(\sin b\bigg)^{\!2} &= \frac{144}{169}, \qquad \text{取平方根: } \qquad \sin b &= \frac{12}{13} \in \big[\sin(0), \sin(360^{\circ})\big].
\end{align}
\]

由于 $a$ 是锐角，所以 $360^{\circ}k + 45^{\circ} \not\in \big[0, 90^{\circ}\big]$. 所以：\[
\begin{align}
\cos(a + b) &= \cos a \cos b - \sin a \sin b, \\
\cos (a + b) &= \frac{3}{5} \cdot \frac{5}{13} - \frac{4}{5} \cdot \frac{12}{13}, \\
\cos(a + b) &= -\frac{33}{65}.
\end{align}
\]
